{"page":97,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:114","surah":4,"ayah":114,"ar_uthmani":"۞ لَّا خَيْرَ فِى كَثِيرٍ مِّن نَّجْوَىٰهُمْ إِلَّا مَنْ أَمَرَ بِصَدَقَةٍ أَوْ مَعْرُوفٍ أَوْ إِصْلَـٰحٍۭ بَيْنَ ٱلنَّاسِ ۚ وَمَن يَفْعَلْ ذَٰلِكَ ٱبْتِغَآءَ مَرْضَاتِ ٱللَّهِ فَسَوْفَ نُؤْتِيهِ أَجْرًا عَظِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is no good in most of their secret talk, only in commanding charity, or good, or reconciliation between people. To anyone who does these things, seeking to please God, We shall give a rich reward;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ لَّا","en_gloss":"(There is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَيْرَ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"khayra","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَثِيرٍۢ","en_gloss":"much","transliteration":"kathīrin","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَّجْوَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"their secret talk","transliteration":"najwāhum","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"(he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَمَرَ","en_gloss":"orders","transliteration":"amara","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِصَدَقَةٍ","en_gloss":"charity","transliteration":"biṣadaqatin","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَعْرُوفٍ","en_gloss":"kindness","transliteration":"maʿrūfin","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِصْلَـٰحٍۭ","en_gloss":"conciliation","transliteration":"iṣ'lāḥin","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"4:114"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_ke